<!--
    Dirge's liveries: one persistent outfit per special type, the
    Scavenger's second state, and the Boss's four borrowed bodies. The
    first six outfits and their item GUIDs are the ones the Bulwark lab
    minted (2026-09), carried over unchanged so the clothing item XMLs and
    fileGuidTable.xml did not have to be re-keyed; only the NAMES took
    Dirge's prefix. Those clothing item files keep their BZ_ file names for
    the same reason: a file name is a path, and the paths inside the item
    XMLs point at the same models and textures on disk. The four RQ_Boss*
    outfits and their eight items were minted here (2026-09-17): twins of
    the four bipeds under the Boss's own items, each with that body's core
    mesh in gold.

    Male and female entries are identical on purpose. The bipeds mask all
    sixteen body parts and carry their own heads, so there is no vanilla
    body left for sex to change - the pair exists because the engine looks
    an outfit up by sex (IsoZombie.java:3881) and a missing entry strips
    the zombie naked before it returns (IsoZombie.java:3878-3882).
-->
